\item Posterior summaries (medians, SDs, 2.5\% and 97.5\% quantiles) for intercepts and all Legendre coefficients
across degrees (returned in \code{hpd_coef}).
\item Probability of being better than the best check (based on posterior draws).
\item An approximate t-test-style comparison versus the best check using posterior SDs and observed counts.
